[I] Launcher for the COSMIC desktop environment

[T] cosmic-launcher is the Wayland layer shell frontend for Pop Launcher in
[T] System76's COSMIC desktop environment. It allows searching and launching
[T] applications, switching windows and running launcher plugins from a
[T] keyboard driven overlay.

[U] https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-launcher/

[A] System76 <info@system76.com>
